OL,3,GNEWSAElderly and vulnerable urged to
OL,4,Aget free vaccines
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople eligible for flu or Covid-19
OL,7,Fvaccinations are being offered free
OL,8,Fjabs for the winter.
OL,10,FThe Government of Jersey said islanders
OL,11,Fwithin certain groups could receive a
OL,12,Fvaccination from Tuesday onwards at
OL,13,Ftheir GP surgery or pharmacy.
OL,15,FEligible groups for the flu jab include
OL,16,Fpeople aged 65 and over, adults in care
OL,17,Fhomes, pregnant women and those with
OL,18,Flong-term health conditions. Covid
OL,19,Fvaccines are available to islanders
OL,20,Faged 75 and over, adults living in care
OL,21,Fhomes and immunocompromised people aged
OL,22,Fsix months and over.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
